BLAKE3 (pas/pjablake3.pas, pas/b3chunks.c): pBLAKE3 v0.2.0
(https://github.com/YadeWira/pBLAKE3, MIT, Yade Bravo), copied unchanged;
written from the BLAKE3 specification and checked against the official
implementation's output.

HTJ2K (pas/pjaj2kht.c, pas/pjaj2kht_tab.h): written from ITU-T T.814 |
ISO/IEC 15444-15, with the encoders' conventions (how the MEL, VLC and
MagSgn segments are ended and fused, the choice among VLC codewords) as
OpenJPH 0.18.2 has them; the VLC tables (pas/pjaj2kht_tab.h) are OpenJPH's
src/core/coding/table0.h and table1.h, which transcribe the standard's.
